COMPILATION OF: E49C4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49C4

   1 a 0000 E49C4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] E49C2's shape under ^= : CA skip on the literal-
   4 a 0006      left equal-length head.  Kept as its own witness so the skip
   5 a 0006      byte is measured in BOTH orientations at equal lengths,
   6 a 0006      independent of what C1/C2 show. */
   7 c 0006   dcl
   8 c 0006     1 rec,
   9 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  10 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  12 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  13 c 0006   if 'ABC' ^= rec.na then k = 1;
  14 c 001B   put list('K=', k);
  15 c 003D   stop;
  16 a 0040 end E49C4;

CODE SIZE = 0040
DATA AREA = 000F
FREE SYMS = 386E
END  COMPILATION
